					<div class="xsmall">3/26/2002 - 3:43 PM PST</div>
					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=3060">Kattank Nobleshadow</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=1952">Kedeos Nobleshadow</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=3517">Skaleskin Nobleshadow</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2035">Baledil</a></div>					
